      </h2>
      <div class="game-meta">
        <span class="badge badge-xbox">Xbox</span>
        <span class="badge badge-pc">PC</span>
        <span class="badge badge-ps5">PS5</span>
        <span class="badge badge-confirmed">Confirmed</span>
        <span class="release-badge">Autumn 2026</span>
      </div>
      <p class="game-description">
        Playground Games • Action RPG • 1,000 handcrafted NPCs • Confirmed for Autumn 2026 • Xbox Game Pass at launch
      </p>
    </div>


  </div>

